    "title": "Word Search: Word Find",
    "description": "<b>Addicting and FREE TO PLAY word search puzzles and classic word games on mobile and tablet!</b>\r\n\r\nExplore new word categories of various difficulties to learn new vocabulary on your quest to train your mind while playing FUN spelling word games in english. \r\nTo play word search games, find and spell english words on the letter grid horizontally, vertically or diagonally to complete the word search.\r\n\r\nFeatures of Word Search:\r\n- 100% FREE TO PLAY word search for seniors and adults of all ages\r\n- 5,000+ levels and categories, easy word search, hard search for your word search quest\r\n- Complete word search puzzles by finding the words\r\n- Fun high quality word search games\r\n- Unlimited word games!!!\r\n- No timers! Play at your own pace!\r\n- No lives! Play unlimited word puzzles!\r\n- Challenge and improve your english by playing in word games in timed or classic mode\r\n- No Ads word search available, enjoy word search online or offline with pen and paper anywhere!\r\n\r\nWord Search is a popular spelling game for learning english around the world. Play Word Search for brain training by solving addicting word puzzles!",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Addicting and FREE TO PLAY word search puzzles and classic word games on mobile and tablet!</b><br><br>Explore new word categories of various difficulties to learn new vocabulary on your quest to train your mind while playing FUN spelling word games in english. <br>To play word search games, find and spell english words on the letter grid horizontally, vertically or diagonally to complete the word search.<br><br>Features of Word Search:<br>- 100% FREE TO PLAY word search for seniors and adults of all ages<br>- 5,000+ levels and categories, easy word search, hard search for your word search quest<br>- Complete word search puzzles by finding the words<br>- Fun high quality word search games<br>- Unlimited word games!!!<br>- No timers! Play at your own pace!<br>- No lives! Play unlimited word puzzles!<br>- Challenge and improve your english by playing in word games in timed or classic mode<br>- No Ads word search available, enjoy word search online or offline with pen and paper anywhere!<br><br>Word Search is a popular spelling game for learning english around the world. Play Word Search for brain training by solving addicting word puzzles!",
